<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Valentine's Day Zsang</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Dancing+Script:wght@700&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400&display=swap');

        body {
            background-color: #fff0f3;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            color: #5c0a1a;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Floating Hearts Animation */
        .heart-bg {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .heart {
            position: absolute;
            color: #ff4d6d;
            animation: float 6s infinite linear;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(0deg); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: translateY(-10vh) rotate(360deg); opacity: 0; }
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffb3c1, #fff0f3);
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin: 0;
            color: #c9184a;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px #ffccd5;
        }

        /* Photo Gallery */
        .gallery {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .polaroid {
            background: white;
            padding: 15px 15px 40px 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transform: rotate(-2deg);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            max-width: 250px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .polaroid img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 300px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .polaroid:nth-child(even) { transform: rotate(3deg); }

        .polaroid:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1) rotate(0deg);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(201, 24, 74, 0.3);
            z-index: 10;
        }

        /* Letter Section */
        .letter-container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            position: relative;
            border-left: 5px solid #ff4d6d;
        }

        .letter-text {
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-align: right;
            color: #c9184a;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="heart-bg" id="heart-bg"></div>

    <header>
        <h1>Happy Valentine's Day, Asawa Qouh! 🩷</h1>
        <p>To my favorite person, my nurse, and my life.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="gallery">
        <div class="polaroid">
            <img src="1000017011.jpg" alt="Under the lights">
        </div>
        <div class="polaroid">
            <img src="1000017018.jpg" alt="Sunset Kiss">
        </div>
        <div class="polaroid">
            <img src="1000016998.jpg" alt="Golf Course Memories">
        </div>
        <div class="polaroid">
            <img src="1000016880.jpg" alt="Mountain View">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="letter-container">
        <div class="letter-text">
Salamat sa pasensya love, alam kong unang paghinga ko palang sa mundo pambbwisit na karakas ko😆 

