Anyways sorry sa emowziyonal na bungad mahal, sa lahat nang inis ko sa buhay ko kahit papaano hinding hindi ko ipagpapalit buhay na ito dahil nariyan ka palagi para sa atin😘 

I feel sorry for my shortcomings mahal ko, pinapangako kong pagbubutihin ko pagbubuo sa sarili ko araw araw dahil gusto kong mabuo araw mo sa panahon na masaya man ito o hindi🤗 

I love you my gwapa lami himos humot kaayo wife! I'm always proud of you my nurse zsang😘 thank you for being extraordinary you my baby🩷
        </div>
        <div class="signature">
            Nagmamahal,<br>Khrishna
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        Forever & Always 🌹
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Create random floating hearts
        const bg = document.getElementById('heart-bg');
        const heartIcons = ['❤', '💖', '💕', '💗', '🌸'];
        
        function createHeart() {
            const heart = document.createElement('div');
            heart.classList.add('heart');
            heart.innerHTML = heartIcons[Math.floor(Math.random() * heartIcons.length)];
            heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
            heart.style.fontSize = Math.random() * 20 + 10 + 'px';
            heart.style.animationDuration = Math.random() * 3 + 3 + 's';
            bg.appendChild(heart);
            
            setTimeout(() => { heart.remove(); }, 6000);
        }

        setInterval(createHeart, 300);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
